Every chain listed has at least one task.

No covering task passes today for: orders -> shipping -> returns. A task that already fails cannot show a change made things worse. Note what it fails on, so a later pass or fail can be read.

For each chain of two or more agents, open its tasks and check what they grade: what changed in the systems at the end of the chain, and each fact that had to survive the handoff. A task that only checks wording, or only the first agent's part, does not cover the chain.
